    "$notes": "expectBackend is asserted per profile (desktop webgpu; mobile webgl2 + Q1 auto-detected from the mobile userAgent with empty query). drawCalls/triangles are the MAX over samples taken every sampleMs across the whole measured window. Console errors, page errors, failed requests and HTTP >=400 fail the profile. Plan 7.4 targets: desktop 60 fps / p99<=16.7 ms / draw<=250 / tris<=800k; mobile >=55 fps / p95<=20 ms / draw<=120 / tris<=250k. Gate floors are looser (55/20 desktop, 50/24 mobile-throttled) because it runs on a shared dev machine with CPU throttle; tighten once the real-device gate (7.5) exists. gpuMs <=6 desktop is recorded, not gated (timer queries opt-in)."
